  demoName: LED Display
  demoDescription: '<b>Showcases:</b> The LED effect on an LED Panel

    <size=45%>
    </size>

    With Grid set to Panel every text lights the same panel''s dots,
    so text scrolled across it snaps dot by dot like a real marquee, and the panel''s
    edge crops it with no mask.

    <size=45%> </size>

    <size=88%><color=#a9b6cf>Intermediate
    setup: 3 texts and 1 LED Panel, no code. The bezel is a demo sprite.</color></size>'
