  demoName: Word Art
  demoDescription: '<b>Showcases:</b> Classic word art, one material per style

    <size=45%>
    </size>

    Each style is a single material: vertical gradients, a white face
    inside a black outline, 3D Extrude, a marble Overlay Texture, a scrolling rainbow.
    The title rides a Banner warp that waves on its own; the climb of business and
    FREE! is a Warp style with Horizontal Distortion.

    <size=45%> </size>

    <size=88%><color=#a9b6cf>Simple
    setup: 8 texts, one material each, no code. The page and the selection box are
    demo art.</color></size>'
