  demoName: Fire
  demoDescription: '<b>Showcases:</b> Text Layers, Distortion, Text Particles

    <size=45%>
    </size>

    The layer behind is a fatter copy whose top edges a flame texture
    drags upward; scrolling it makes the licks rise. The embers are particles: hot
    dots and streaks born along the floor that rise on wavy paths behind the title,
    popping in and shrinking away.

    <size=45%> </size>

    <size=88%><color=#a9b6cf>Intermediate
    setup: 1 title with 1 layer and 2 particle emitters, no code. The floor glow
    is a demo sprite.</color></size>'
  postprocessConfigSO: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b9d778fef35ae1e4fab6f51008fd7428, type: 2}
  camerasConfiguration: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 85d88584f784ea74496504b2bb2a74cd, type: 2}
