  demoName: Metallic
  demoDescription: '<b>Showcases:</b> Bevel with a normal map, Specular and Reflections

    <size=45%>
    </size>

    Metal is mostly the reflection cubemap plus a light that moves:
    sweeping Light Angle makes the highlights run along the edges. A real metal normal
    map adds the brushing.

    <size=45%> </size>

    <size=88%><color=#a9b6cf>Intermediate
    setup: 2 texts. The light sweep is the demo''s tween script.</color></size>'
  postprocessConfigSO: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 69e4b0b58a886734ea34afd3e22cddf5, type: 2}
