  demoName: Bevels
  demoDescription: '<b>Showcases:</b> One Bevel, three materials

    <size=45%>
    </size>

    Symmetric with Specular reads as a cut gem, Classic over a wood
    texture as carved wood, Affect Outlines as jelly. One light sweeps across all
    three, and the Wave UV effect rippling out of each letter''s middle makes the
    jelly jiggle, highlights included.

    <size=45%> </size>

    <size=88%><color=#a9b6cf>Simple
    setup: 3 texts. The light sweep is the demo''s tween script.</color></size>'
