  demoName: Fight Intro
  demoDescription: '<b>Showcases:</b> Stacked outlines on metal faces, flying on
    splines

    <size=45%> </size>

    Stack outlines widest first: an HDR outer
    ring plus bloom reads as an aura, and pulsing its width keeps it alive. Under
    the rings, a Gradient face with Bevel, Specular and Extrude turns READY into
    steel and FIGHT! into molten metal. Both words fly in and out on splines.

    <size=45%>
    </size>

    <size=88%><color=#a9b6cf>Intermediate setup: 2 texts. A demo script
    times the intro and the glows; the scrolling band and the burst are demo sprites.</color></size>'
