  moveAwayOnHide: 0
  drawGizmos: 0
  demoName: Comms
  demoDescription: '<b>Showcases:</b> A sci-fi typewriter: decode reveal, static
    hide, glitchy word tags

    <size=45%> </size>

    Letters decode out of a
    stretched flicker (the Flicker ease) and break into static between lines. Slide,
    Offset and Dangle tags make words wobble, stutter and droop like a failing signal,
    over a Glitch shader. The voice meter is one text of | bars, each its own Scale
    tag at a different speed.

    <size=45%> </size>

    <size=88%><color=#a9b6cf>Intermediate
    setup: 8 texts; the dialogue flow is code. The panel, brackets and scanlines
    are demo sprites.</color></size>'
