  demoName: Splines
  demoDescription: '<b>Showcases:</b> Text on splines: placed, scrolling, looping

    <size=45%>
    </size>

    Baseline Offset lifts the letters onto the rail instead of centring
    them on it, Rotate With Curve turns them with the track, and the enter and exit
    window pops them in and out at the ends.

    <size=45%> </size>

    <size=88%><color=#a9b6cf>Simple
    setup: 2 texts, no code. The rail dots are demo sprites.</color></size>'
