--- !u!114 &957660391
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 957660389}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 944ba26fbfd0e0643b9ae91071b682d2, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  tweens: []
  rectTransform: {fileID: 957660390}
  materialConfigurators:
  - {fileID: 1018538626}
  - {fileID: 77150011}
  typewriters:
  - {fileID: 1018538625}
  - {fileID: 77150010}
  moveAwayOnHide: 0
  drawGizmos: 0
  demoName: Torchlight
  demoDescription: '<b>Showcases:</b> Interactive: material values driven by the
    mouse

    <size=45%> </size>

    Move the mouse and the Bevel and Extrude light
    come from it, rising and brightening as it gets close, with a faint warm Shine
    under it. Click and the Twist UV effect swirls the letters at that point, then
    settles. Left alone, the torch circles by itself. Embers rise off the torch from
    a particle emitter in canvas space, so they trail behind it as it moves.

    <size=45%>
    </size>

    <size=88%><color=#a9b6cf>Intermediate setup: 2 texts and 1 particle
    emitter. A demo script turns the mouse position into the material''s light angle,
    elevation, shine and twist and sets the embers'' rate; the halo, flash, lit wall
    and dust are demo art.</color></size>'
  postprocessConfigSO: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c27b4cd2769002440b9289c6bbb38ad4, type: 2}
  camerasConfiguration: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 85d88584f784ea74496504b2bb2a74cd, type: 2}
  steps:
  - spline: {fileID: 0}
    typewriter: {fileID: 1018538625}
    fader: {fileID: 0}
    showAt: 0.05
    hideAt: -1
  - spline: {fileID: 0}
    typewriter: {fileID: 77150010}
    fader: {fileID: 0}
    showAt: 1
    hideAt: -1
  loopLength: 100000
  fadeInOnShow: []
  fadeOnHide: []
