  demoName: Asset Title
  demoDescription: '<b>Showcases:</b> The asset''s own title: one word, four materials

    <size=45%>
    </size>

    Each letter of TEXT is its own text with its own material: glossy
    jelly (a low Bevel light and tight Specular keep the colour), a neon grid (an
    Overlay Texture whose lines go bright through Overlay Glow), a crystal cut by
    a symmetric Bevel with Reflections, and fire (gradient noise rising through a
    flame ramp). The white lines are an Arc Warp on a tilt.

    <size=45%> </size>

    <size=88%><color=#a9b6cf>Intermediate
    setup: 6 texts, no code. The brush stroke is a demo sprite.</color></size>'
