--- !u!114 &1188731580
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1188731578}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 944ba26fbfd0e0643b9ae91071b682d2, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  tweens: []
  rectTransform: {fileID: 1188731579}
  materialConfigurators:
  - {fileID: 1636350097}
  - {fileID: 1179255425}
  typewriters:
  - {fileID: 1636350095}
  - {fileID: 1179255424}
  moveAwayOnHide: 0
  drawGizmos: 0
  demoName: Chameleon
  demoDescription: '<b>Showcases:</b> The colour filters, a moving light and a morphing
    Warp

    <size=45%> </size>

    Hue Shift, Greyscale, Posterize, Contrast and
    Brightness and Color Grading are filters over the finished text, lights and outlines
    included. Easing them together, with the Bevel and Extrude light swinging to
    a new angle and colour, walks one material through stone, leaf, sunset, coral
    and night. The filters run Color Grading, Hue Shift, Contrast, Posterize, Greyscale,
    so a warm grading gets rotated by the hue. Each environment also has its own
    Warp shape, a preset baked into a Custom cage: blending the cage points morphs
    the word from a boulder to a leaf, the sun''s arch, a fish and a hunch.

    <size=45%>
    </size>

    <size=88%><color=#a9b6cf>Intermediate setup: 2 texts, 1 material.
    A demo script eases the material values and the Warp per stage and retypes the
    caption; the skin is an Overlay Texture, the glow a demo sprite.</color></size>'
  postprocessConfigSO: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 198b4260c2a7ef549a94381a278a3b66, type: 2}
  camerasConfiguration: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 85d88584f784ea74496504b2bb2a74cd, type: 2}
  steps:
  - spline: {fileID: 0}
    typewriter: {fileID: 1636350095}
    fader: {fileID: 0}
    showAt: 0.05
    hideAt: -1
  - spline: {fileID: 0}
    typewriter: {fileID: 1179255424}
    fader: {fileID: 0}
    showAt: 0.7
    hideAt: -1
  loopLength: 100000
  fadeInOnShow: []
  fadeOnHide: []
