  moveAwayOnHide: 0
  drawGizmos: 0
  demoName: Treasure Map
  demoDescription: '<b>Showcases:</b> Fade dissolve with a burn edge

    <size=45%>
    </size>

    Fade dissolves the text through a noise texture, and Burn Color
    draws a glowing edge along the dissolve. Taking Fade Amount from 1 to 0 on reveal
    burns the title in, back to 1 on hide burns it away. Charred ink, an ember Inner
    Glow that breathes and a soft scorch shadow keep it burnt into the map.

    <size=45%>
    </size>

    <size=88%><color=#a9b6cf>Intermediate setup: 2 texts. A small demo
    script eases Fade Amount from the typewriter''s events, the ember breathing is
    the demo''s tween script, the parchment is a demo sprite.</color></size>'
  postprocessConfigSO: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 01fc58d61fb923b439f8e07a3721db3f, type: 2}
