  demoName: Color Ramp
  demoDescription: '<b>Showcases:</b> Color Ramp in its After Effects stage

    <size=45%>
    </size>

    The ramp recolours the finished text by brightness, so build the
    brightness first (a glowing core for thermal, a grainy bevel for night vision,
    a frontal light for x-ray) and let the ramp do the rest.

    <size=45%> </size>

    <size=88%><color=#a9b6cf>Intermediate
    setup: 3 texts, one material each, no code.</color></size>'
