  moveAwayOnHide: 0
  drawGizmos: 0
  demoName: Electric
  demoDescription: '<b>Showcases:</b> Text Layers, stepped Distortion, Flicker, Text
    Particles

    <size=45%> </size>

    Four additive copies with black faces
    add only their lines: a ragged rim, arcs crawling over the faces, white and yellow
    arcs. Stepped distortion makes every line jump to a new shape instead of flowing.
    Particle emitters root bolts on the word''s outline and crackle them through
    a flipbook, each strike flashing the haze behind, while sparks blink around the
    word and flares pop on its edges.

    <size=45%> </size>

    <size=88%><color=#a9b6cf>Expert
    setup: 1 text with 4 layers and 5 particle emitters, no code. The backdrop and
    haze are demo sprites.</color></size>'
  postprocessConfigSO: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 32a817d0104855947bad0c6f1fda7c6c, type: 2}
  camerasConfiguration: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 85d88584f784ea74496504b2bb2a74cd, type: 2}
