  demoName: Harvest Valley
  demoDescription: '<b>Showcases:</b> Wind, the grass sway

    <size=45%> </size>

    Wind
    bends each letter from its foot like grain in a breeze: a sway with a steady
    lean, a wave travelling along the line and gusts that come and go, all on the
    GPU with no animation keys. The sign rocks as a demo sprite; the falling leaves
    are a particle emitter with sway, spin and Flutter.

    <size=45%> </size>

    <size=88%><color=#a9b6cf>Simple
    setup: 3 texts and 1 particle emitter, no code for the text. The sign and hills
    are demo sprites and scripts.</color></size>'
  postprocessConfigSO: {fileID: 11400000, guid: cb5c4309a73e8c24aa159eb3d97520ef, type: 2}
  camerasConfiguration: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 85d88584f784ea74496504b2bb2a74cd, type: 2}
  steps:
  - spline: {fileID: 0}
    typewriter: {fileID: 1549800830}
