  moveAwayOnHide: 0
  drawGizmos: 0
  demoName: Rarity Tiers
  demoDescription: '<b>Showcases:</b> Stacking effects to show value

    <size=45%>
    </size>

    Each tier adds more than the one below: rust, then enamel and a
    bright rim, then frost cracks and a refraction wobble, then molten veins, a pulsing
    glow and a slow wave. Overlay Glow above 1 makes veins and cracks light up. The
    top two tiers add Text Particles as a finishing touch: a glow behind the letters,
    then rare energy motes drifting up beside the word and golden embers rising off
    the legendary one, with tiny glints on the letters.

    <size=45%> </size>

    <size=88%><color=#a9b6cf>Expert
    setup: 8 texts and 9 particle emitters. The glow pulse is the demo''s tween script.</color></size>'
  postprocessConfigSO: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 830eac838b2431049a5887e7efc6e1c0, type: 2}
  camerasConfiguration: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 85d88584f784ea74496504b2bb2a74cd, type: 2}
  steps:
  - spline: {fileID: 0}
    typewriter: {fileID: 1784152634}
    fader: {fileID: 0}
    showAt: 0.05
    hideAt: -1
