  demoName: Countdown
  demoDescription: '<b>Showcases:</b> Typewriter events driving a scene

    <size=45%>
    </size>

    Each number''s reveal events light its glow. When GO! lands, its
    Reveal Completed event fires the squash and the shake and plays three Text Particles
    emitters: dust thrown along the ground and a flat flash behind the word, sparks
    in front. Emitters that play on Reveal Completed always match the landing.

    <size=45%>
    </size>

    <size=88%><color=#a9b6cf>Intermediate setup: 4 texts and 3 particle
    emitters. Demo scripts time the numbers and play the squash and shake; the glows
    and burst are sprites.</color></size>'
  postprocessConfigSO: {fileID: 11400000, guid: eea0626b3536ecf4eab2faf0100a5d44, type: 2}
  camerasConfiguration: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 85d88584f784ea74496504b2bb2a74cd, type: 2}
