  moveAwayOnHide: 0
  drawGizmos: 0
  demoName: Awaken
  demoDescription: '<b>Showcases:</b> Text Particles: per letter sparks, triggers
    and code control

    <size=45%> </size>

    Each letter throws its own sparks
    the moment the typewriter starts it (Per Letter emission). While the word charges,
    a ring emitter with a negative speed pulls streaks into it and code raises its
    Rate Multiplier; the orb is three one shot emitters. The gold word''s burst and
    shockwave fire on its own Reveal Completed trigger, and the closing flash and
    flare on Hide Completed, when the word has shrunk to nothing.

    <size=45%>
    </size>

    <size=88%><color=#a9b6cf>Intermediate setup: 2 texts and 13 emitters
    made from the particle Presets menu, then tuned. A demo script times the charge,
    the glow, the orb, the flash, the shake and the backdrop change.</color></size>'
